<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daewoo wins $470 mln in oil tanker order.</title>
<headline>Daewoo wins $470 mln in oil tanker order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daewoo Heavy Industries Co, a unit of Daewoo Group, said on Tuesday it had recently won a total of $470 million in orders to build seven oil tankers.</p>
</text>
